    subgraph Trace结构
        A[Gateway Span 50ms] --> B[Auth Span 5ms]
        A --> C[Product Span 35ms]
        C --> D[DB Query Span 20ms]
        C --> E[Cache Span 2ms]
        A --> F[Payment Span 8ms]
    end
    subgraph 关键路径
